WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Make a scene from a photo.

2
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.400
An adult can turn a photo of a real place,
like the kitchen, into a strip of words.

3
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.200
The main board does not move.

4
00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.500
Take a photo of the place.

5
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:19.500
V.O.I.C.E. finds things in the photo and suggests
words that go with them.

6
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:25.500
It only suggests things it is at least
40% sure of.

7
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.500
Untick anything you do not want.

8
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:37.600
If nothing was found, you can draw a box
around each thing by hand instead.

9
00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:43.000
Name the scene, then choose to use it.

10
00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:47.500
Nothing is saved until you choose to.

11
00:00:48.500 --> 00:00:53.000
The scene shows as a separate strip,

12
00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:57.000
so the core words stay where they are.

13
00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:00.000
V.O.I.C.E. A free AAC app for children
who are new to AAC.
